# Fail-safe allow-list: ignore everything, then permit only reviewed files.
#
# Rationale: the photo EXIF and most ODM outputs contain GPS coordinates that
# identify the property (odm_report/shots.geojson has per-camera lon/lat;
# odm_georeferencing/coords.txt holds the UTM origin). The image set and
# intermediate SfM data are also ~1 GB. Ignoring by default means a future
# rerun that writes new coordinate-bearing output stays out unless allowed
# here explicitly.
#
# Note: .gitignore does not support trailing comments — a comment after a
# pattern on the same line becomes part of the pattern.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!run-odm.sh

# Coordinate-free run metadata, kept for reproducibility:
# options.json  - full resolved ODM parameter set
# benchmark.txt - per-stage timings
# cameras.json  - camera intrinsics model
!options.json
!benchmark.txt
!cameras.json
